// Compiler Pass-Timing (`--time-passes`) & Code-Size (`--size-report`) Telemetry Engine,
// Profile Cost-Model Policies (`-O0`/`-O1`/`-O2`/`-Os`/`-Oz`), Bounded Auto-Tuning (`AutoTuneBudget`),
// and Reproducible Build Provenance Isolation (T625 / E15.7).
// Implements SPEC-76 §§4..8 (AXS-PERF-001..032; REQ-OPT-242..245, REQ-OPT-253, REQ-OPT-255,
// REQ-OPT-292..295, REQ-OPT-334, REQ-OPT-381..382):
//   - Five canonical optimization profiles (`PERF_OPT_O0`, `PERF_OPT_O1`, `PERF_OPT_O2`, `PERF_OPT_OS`,
//     `PERF_OPT_OZ`) with explicit cost-model thresholds (`ProfileCostPolicy`), monomorphization
//     body-sharing profitability (`perf_can_share_monomorphized_body`), and zero mandatory monolithic
//     runtime dependency (`requires_monolithic_runtime == false`) (`AXS-PERF-010..014`, `REQ-OPT-292..295`, `REQ-OPT-334`)
//   - Bounded auto-tuning (`AutoTuneBudget`, `AutoTuneCandidate`, `AutoTuneResult`, `perf_autotune_evaluate`)
//     enforcing legality-before-profitability (`!is_legality_proven` rejected unconditionally) and hard
//     candidate/iteration/wall-time/memory budgets (`AXS-PERF-004`, `REQ-OPT-242..243`)
//   - Deterministic artifact provenance (`ArtifactProvenanceHeader`, `perf_compute_artifact_provenance`)
//     and strict telemetry orthogonality (`perf_verify_telemetry_orthogonality`): wall-clock timing
//     never enters cache keys or emitted binary bytes (`AXS-PERF-004`, `AXS-PERF-032`, `REQ-OPT-244..245`)
//   - Structured `--time-passes` collector & human/JSON formatters (`PassTimingRecord`, `TimePassesReport`,
//     `time_passes_format_human`, `time_passes_format_json`) (`AXS-PERF-030`, `REQ-OPT-253`)
//   - Structured `--size-report` 3D binary footprint, section layout (`StartupEntrySet` -> `HotCluster` ->
//     `WarmNormal` -> `ColdSplit`), alignment padding budget (`<= 2%` of `.text`), and deterministic
//     symbol attribution (`SizeReport`, `size_report_build_from_section_graph`, `size_report_format_human`,
//     `size_report_format_json`) (`AXS-PERF-020..022`, `AXS-PERF-031`, `REQ-OPT-381..382`)
module compiler.driver.perf_telemetry

